  "summary": "Nmap before 7.992 contains an information disclosure vulnerability in the Nmap Scripting Engine because nse_main.lua…",
  "details": "Nmap before 7.992 contains an information disclosure vulnerability in the Nmap Scripting Engine because nse_main.lua does not explicitly seed Lua's math.random generator. Malicious scanned hosts can observe math.random-derived values in NSE script traffic during -sC scans, brute-force the seed, and recover a heap address that weakens ASLR.",
